### Create inventory
POST http://localhost:8080/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productCode": "FR001",
  "stockCode": "STK-101",
  "productName": "French Orange",
  "description": "Imported orange from France",
  "metadata": {
    "category": "fruit"
  }
}

### Create valid unit
POST http://localhost:8080/unit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "unitCode": "CRATE",
  "unitName": "Crate",
  "description": "Bulk crate",
  "validForInventory": true,
  "compatibilityPriority": 10
}

### Search with defaults
POST http://localhost:8080/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "french orange crate",
  "includeCandidates": true
}

### Search with runtime model override
POST http://localhost:8080/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "milk ltr",
  "chatModel": "gpt-5.5",
  "fallbackModel": "gpt-5.4-mini",
  "embeddingModel": "text-embedding-3-small",
  "includeCandidates": true
}
